id: combat-wisdom
name: Combat Wisdom
talentCategory: insightful
prerequisites: Insight Score of 10+, Insightful Warrior
description: >
  You are able to substitute your skill and experience in battle for raw, unbridled power.
text: >
  Combat Wisdom: You are able to substitute your skill and experience in battle for raw, unbridled power.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score of 10+, Insightful Warrior
  (1)-[Passive]: While benefiting from the effect of Insightful Warrior, increase your Insight Modifier by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you use the Signature Technique Maneuver while benefiting from the effect of Insightful Warrior, increase your Wound Rolls and Might by 1(T) for the duration of that Maneuver.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you would use the Defend Maneuver while benefiting from the effect of Insightful Warrior, increase your Damage Reduction by 2(T) for the duration of that Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1)
if (benefiting("Insightful Warrior")) {
  insight.mod += 1(T);
}

# (2) A Signature Technique declared: asked in its window, once a Round - Combat Wisdom (a mark), Wound Rolls and Might 1(T),
# off once that attack is concluded (chat.mjs combatWisdomEnds) or at the end of the turn at the latest.
[triggered/declare-maneuver, 1/round, effect 2]
requires signatureTechnique && benefiting("Insightful Warrior");
gain(combat-wisdom-mark);
expires(combat-wisdom-mark, turn);

# (3) The Defend Maneuver used against an attack: its Damage Reduction 2(T) more for it, once a Round (chat.mjs, where the
# Damage Reduction is).
[triggered/defending, 1/round, effect 3]
requires benefiting("Insightful Warrior");
damageReduction += 2(T);
